# Responsive Public Web

## Breakpoints
- `sm` (640px): grid column bump
- `md` (768px): layout direction flip, padding bump
- `lg` (1024px): desktop nav, horizontalna skica

## Skica (FormationPitch)
- `< lg`: vertikalna (`aspect-[3/4]`), koordinate remap via `mapPitchPosition()`, token `-rotate-90`
- `≥ lg`: horizontalna (`aspect-[16/9]`)
- Koristiti `ResponsiveFormationPitch` wrapper na svim stranicama sa skicom

## Timeline mobilni (`/o-klubu`)
- Bez linije i tačaka na `< lg`
- Scroll-snap kartice (`snap-y snap-mandatory`)

## Grb
- `club.crestUrl` (PNG) → header logo + dynamic favicon
- Fallback na `club.name` tekst

## Mobile UX
- Drawer/sheet umjesto modala na malim ekranima
- Container: `mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6`
- Test: 375px, 768px, 1280px — bez horizontalnog overflowa

## Premium landing
- CMS widgeti u `AnimatedSection` shellu
- `framer-motion` + `prefers-reduced-motion` fallback obavezno
